      "subject": "Eliya",
      "rationale": "Yahwe i askim Eliya dairek: 'Yu lukim pinis olsem Akab…?'"
    },
    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "נכנע ... נכנע",
      "rationale": "Tupela daunim yet i kamap wan taim — kros bilong tok i stap long olsem lain, na Tok Pisin i holim daunim daunim."
